45	// New returns a new Pgx v5 River driver for use with River.
46	//
47	// It takes a pgxpool.Pool to use for use with River. The pool should already be
48	// configured to use the schema specified in the client's Schema field. The pool
49	// must not be closed while associated River objects are running.
50	//
51	// The database pool may be nil. If it is, a client that it's sent into will not
52	// be able to start up (calls to Start will error) and the Insert and InsertMany
53	// functions will be disabled, but the transactional-variants InsertTx and
54	// InsertManyTx continue to function. This behavior may be particularly useful
55	// in testing so that inserts can be performed and verified on a test
56	// transaction that will be rolled back.
